{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "BSB",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 56,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the choirmaster. To the tune of “A Dove on Distant Oaks.” A Miktam of David, when the Philistines seized him in Gath. Be merciful to me, O God, for men are hounding me; all day they press their attack.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My enemies pursue me all day long, for many proudly assail me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When I am afraid, I put my trust in You.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In God, whose word I praise — in God I trust. I will not be afraid. What can man do to me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All day long they twist my words; all their thoughts are on my demise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They conspire, they lurk, they watch my steps while they wait to take my life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In spite of such sin, will they escape? In Your anger, O God, cast down the nations.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "You have taken account of my wanderings. Put my tears in Your bottle — are they not in Your book?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then my enemies will retreat on the day I cry for help. By this I will know that God is on my side.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In God, whose word I praise, in the LORD, whose word I praise,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "in God I trust; I will not be afraid. What can man do to me?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Your vows are upon me, O God; I will render thank offerings to You.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.56.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "BSB:PSA.56.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For You have delivered my soul from death, and my feet from stumbling, that I may walk before God in the light of life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
